OL,5,G2100 999: Critical Condition
OL,6,     FDocumentary series following the
OL,7,     Fwork of a major hospital trauma
OL,8,     Funit. Helen has a life-threatening
OL,9,     Faneurism in her brain which could
OL,10,     Fburst at any time.
OL,11,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,12,     FThe team at Hull Royal Infirmary
OL,13,     Fhas another busy night: a man is
OL,14,     Finvolved in a motorbike collision
OL,15,     Fwith a deer and a young patient is
OL,16,     Fin agony with his ankle facing the
OL,17,     Fwrong way.
