OL,3,Vupppppp5CFriday
OL,5,G0100 Murdered at First Sight
OL,6,     FIn 2007, the Petit home in
OL,7,     FConnecticut is invaded. Jennifer,
OL,8,     FMichaela, and Hayley are brutally
OL,9,     Fmurdered by Hayes and
OL,10,     FKomisarjevsky. Only William Petit
OL,11,     Fsurvives the horrific attack.
OL,12,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FThe team continues to work
OL,14,     Ftogether to help the ill and
OL,15,     Finjured of South Yorkshire, aiding
OL,16,     Fpatients suffer-ing from heart
OL,17,     Fattacks, road traffic collisions
OL,18,     Fand allergic reactions.
